  "notes": "USAGE:\nPraise for looks or style: an attractive person (traditionally a man, now also women with a \"cool\" style), stylish things such as cars and clothes, and admirable behavior or attitudes.\n\nWATCH OUT:\nThe ⟦いい→いい：00118_ii⟧ part conjugates like ⟦いい→いい：00118_ii⟧: the negative is かっこよくない and the past かっこよかった (not かっこ⟦いくない→いい：00118_ii⟧).\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦かわいい→かわいい：00857_kawaii⟧: cute\n- かっこ⟦{悪|わる}い→悪い：00908_warui⟧: uncool, embarrassing\n\nWRITING:\nAlso written ⟦{格好|かっこう}いい→格好いい：18585_kakkouii⟧ or カッコ⟦いい→いい：00118_ii⟧.",
